sections.body:
The **number** rule is the most frequent and is often hidden. If it seems that nothing changes, count:

- total shapes and shapes by type;
- total sides of all the shapes;
- straight lines and curved lines, separately;
- intersections between lines;
- right angles;
- elements inside a shape vs outside;
- black vs white elements.

Write the counts under each frame (e.g. 3, 5, 7, 9): they become a number series, which you solve with the differences method (see the lesson on series).
